@Service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5071

# Autenticación (Modulo 14). Ver docs/api-auth.md.
#  - Operador (alta de tenants, API keys): header X-Admin-Key contra Security:AdminApiKey.
#    Vacío en Development => los endpoints /tenants quedan abiertos.
#  - Cliente (POST /ecf, secuencias, certificados): header X-API-Key con un token nfe_...
#    En Development todavía sirve X-Tenant-Id sin credencial.
@adminKey =
@apiKey = sk_nfe_test_pon-aqui-el-token-que-devuelve-POST-/tenants/{id}/api-keys

### Register a tenant
POST {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "rnc": "101672919",
  "legalName": "Contribuyente de Prueba SRL",
  "tradeName": "Prueba",
  "plan": "Developer"
}

### Acuñar una API key para el contribuyente (recurso de operador; el token se ve una sola vez)
# environment por defecto = el del perfil de emisor. Requiere perfil + cert + secuencias de ese ambiente.
POST {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/api-keys
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

{ "label": "Local", "environment": "Test" }

### Listar / revocar API keys del contribuyente
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/api-keys
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

### List tenants
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants?page=1&pageSize=20&search=Prueba
Accept: application/json

### Get one tenant
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

###

# ==========================================================================
#  e-CF preview  —  SOLO Development. Genera el XML sin firmar ni enviar.
# ==========================================================================

### Lista los ejemplos (uno por tipo)
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/ecf-preview/samples
Accept: application/json

### El XML de un ejemplo (JSON con { xml, xsdValid })
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/ecf-preview/samples/compras
Accept: application/json

### El XML crudo de un ejemplo (?raw=true)  — cabecera X-Ecf-Xsd-Valid
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/ecf-preview/samples/exportacion?raw=true

### El RFCE de un ejemplo tipo 32
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/ecf-preview/samples/consumo?rfce=true&raw=true

### POST — cuerpo crudo (todo tiene defaults; en el mínimo alcanza el tipo + líneas)
POST {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/ecf-preview
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 31,
  "lines": [
    { "rate": 1, "name": "Consultoria", "unitPrice": 1000 },
    { "rate": 2, "name": "Seguro", "unitPrice": 500 },
    { "rate": 4, "name": "Medicamento", "unitPrice": 300 }
  ]
}

### POST — compras (41) con retencion por linea
POST {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/ecf-preview?raw=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 41,
  "lines": [
    { "rate": 1, "name": "Servicio informal", "unitPrice": 5000,
      "retention": { "agent": 1, "itbisWithheld": 270, "isrWithheld": 500 } }
  ]
}

### POST — credito fiscal en USD (bloque OtraMoneda)
POST {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/ecf-preview?raw=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 31,
  "foreignCurrency": {
    "currency": "USD",
    "exchangeRate": 58.50,
    "totals": { "montoGravadoTotal": 34.19, "montoGravadoI1": 34.19,
                "totalItbis": 6.15, "totalItbis1": 6.15, "montoTotal": 40.34 }
  },
  "lines": [ { "rate": 1, "name": "Item", "unitPrice": 2000 } ]
}

### POST — descuento global (Seccion D) sobre la tasa 18%
POST {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/ecf-preview?raw=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 31,
  "globalAdjustments": [
    { "line": 1, "kind": 1, "affectsRate": 1, "amount": 1000, "description": "Descuento por volumen", "percentage": 10 }
  ],
  "lines": [ { "rate": 1, "name": "Mercancia", "unitPrice": 10000 } ]
}

### POST rfce — resumen del tipo 32
POST {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/ecf-preview/rfce?raw=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "document": {
    "type": 32,
    "sequenceExpiresOn": null,
    "buyer": { "name": "Consumidor Final", "rnc": null },
    "lines": [ { "rate": 1, "name": "Producto", "unitPrice": 800 } ]
  },
  "securityCode": "aB3xZ9"
}

### GET — un ejemplo YA FIRMADO (Modulo 3, cert autofirmado efimero; la DGII no la aceptaria)
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/ecf-preview/samples/credito-fiscal?signed=true&raw=true

### GET — tipo 32 de bajo monto firmado -> el RFCE firmado (atado al e-CF por el codigo de seguridad)
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/ecf-preview/samples/consumo?signed=true&rfce=true&raw=true

### POST — cuerpo crudo, firmado (JSON con xml + securityCode + documentHash + qrUrl)
POST {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/ecf-preview?signed=true
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": 31,
  "lines": [ { "rate": 1, "name": "Item gravado", "unitPrice": 1000 } ]
}

###

# ============================================================================
#  Sandbox de desarrollo — onboarding en un paso (solo Development)
#  Deja un contribuyente listo para emitir contra el simulador de la DGII.
#  Ver docs/local-e2e.md.
# ============================================================================

### Onboarding: registra tenant + perfil + secuencias + certificado autofirmado
POST {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/sandbox
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### Solo el certificado autofirmado (por si prefieres subirlo a mano)
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/dev/sandbox/certificate?rnc=130862346

###

# ============================================================================
#  Modulo 12 — emision de e-CF (POST /api/v1/ecf)
#  Requiere: tenant registrado + perfil de emisor + certificado + rango de secuencias.
#  (o corre el sandbox de arriba: devuelve tenantId y apiKey)
#  Auth: header X-API-Key con {{apiKey}}, o X-Tenant-Id en Development.
# ============================================================================

@tenantId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000

### 0. Perfil fiscal del emisor (recurso de operador; una sola vez por contribuyente)
PUT {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/tenants/{{tenantId}}/emitter-profile
Content-Type: application/json
X-Admin-Key: {{adminKey}}

{
  "address": "Av. 27 de Febrero 100, Santo Domingo",
  "municipality": "010100",
  "province": "010000",
  "phones": ["809-555-0100"],
  "email": "facturacion@almax.do",
  "economicActivity": "Comercio al por menor",
  "defaultEnvironment": "Test"
}

### 1. Emitir un Credito Fiscal (tipo 31)
POST {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ecf
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}
Idempotency-Key: demo-fac-2026-00042

{
  "type": 31,
  "incomeType": "01",
  "internalNumber": "FAC-2026-00042",
  "buyer": { "rnc": "131880681", "name": "Mi Cliente SRL" },
  "payment": {
    "condition": "credit",
    "dueDate": "15-03-2026",
    "methods": [ { "type": "check_transfer", "amount": 2360.00 } ]
  },
  "lines": [
    { "name": "Servicio de consultoria", "kind": "service", "quantity": 1,
      "unitOfMeasure": "43", "unitPrice": 2000.00, "itbisRate": 1 }
  ]
}

### 2. Emitir una Factura de Consumo de bajo monto (tipo 32 -> RFCE)
POST {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ecf
Content-Type: application/json
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

{
  "type": 32,
  "incomeType": "01",
  "payment": { "condition": "cash", "methods": [ { "type": "cash", "amount": 1180.00 } ] },
  "lines": [
    { "name": "Almuerzo ejecutivo", "kind": "good", "quantity": 1,
      "unitOfMeasure": "43", "unitPrice": 1000.00, "itbisRate": 1 }
  ]
}

### 3. Consultar un comprobante emitido
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ecf/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 4. Descargar el XML firmado
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ecf/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/xml
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 4b. Representación Impresa en PDF (Modulo 9). ?download=true para descargar
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ecf/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/representation
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 4c. Representación Impresa para rollo térmico de 80 mm (punto de venta)
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ecf/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/representation?layout=pos
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 5. Listar los comprobantes del tenant (paginado, filtros opcionales)
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ecf?page=1&pageSize=20&type=31&search=E31
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 6. Listar solo los rechazados / en revisión
GET {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ecf?status=rejected
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

### 7. Reencolar el envío de un comprobante failed / review
POST {{Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/ecf/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/retry
X-Tenant-Id: {{tenantId}}

###
